366	   * agents working under it (#208). The guard's notice says so: "wait for the
367	   * subtree" reads differently from "a run is going right now", and the person
368	   * who wrote during a park needs the resume moment, not the run, named.
369	   */
370	  parked: boolean;
371	  /**
