415	 * back to the entry that carries it so the time comes from the same read, and the newest
416	 * `waiting` ending is what says a park holds the turn. Walking backwards and skipping
417	 * quotations, the rule every walk in this file applies — a quotation carries the removed
418	 * author's tags verbatim.
