48	 * sub-issue:
49	 *
50	 *   - `children` — `launch_sub_agent` starts an issue under this node and parks on it;
51	 *     the aggregation resumes the parent when the last one closes.
52	 *   - `pullRequests` — `create_pr` parks on the PULL REQUEST it just opened
53	 *     (`entrypoints/tools/mcp/github.ts` posts `ended=waiting` on the issue and
54	 *     dispatches validation for the PR). A leaf issue has no sub-issues at all, so
55	 *     counting only children would read that park as "nothing is open under this node"
56	 *     while a reviewer was working its pull request — and release it mid-review.
57	 *
