12	 *
13	 * A node that could not be read, or whose run status came back unreadable, is not a failure
14	 * of the sweep: the next sweep is fifteen minutes away and the node is exactly as it was. A
15	 * release that was posted and did NOT clear the claim is different — the node now carries a
16	 * comment saying the turn came back beside a thread that says it did not, and nothing but a
17	 * person can fix it. That is the one state worth a red run.
